/**
 * Seeds the three default accounts at startup — and only when the {@code users}
 * table contains no rows (nothing is inserted on later restarts with existing data):
 * {@code admin/admin123 (ADMIN)}, {@code user1/user123 (USER)},
 * {@code user2/user456 (USER)}, each with the current timestamp.
